<title>JAPAN: Japan May vehicle exports up 28.8 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Japan May vehicle exports up 28.8 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan's vehicle exports rose 28.8 percent in May to 346,532 units from a year earlier, the Japan Automobile Manufacturers' Association (JAMA) said on Thursday.</p>
<p>It was the 12th successive month in which exports rose on a year-on-year basis.</p>
</text>
